# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Health Coach currently provides a basic dashboard. There are plans to expand the service, but personalised health coaching and LLM-driven recommendations are not part of its current functionality.

The service follows the earlier exploratory project [AI Health Coach](/documentation/services/aihc).

## Architecture Overview

The dashboard has a frontend and a backend deployed on ECS Fargate, backed by a PostgreSQL database hosted on Amazon RDS.

The frontend configuration supplies the API URL. The user's browser sends requests directly to the backend, which handles application logic and database access.

![Health Coach architecture diagram](/images/healthcoach-architecture.png)

## Components

### Applications

- [healthcoach-platform-frontend](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/healthcoach-platform-frontend): dashboard frontend.
- [healthcoach-platform-backend](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/healthcoach-platform-backend): backend API.

### Infrastructure as Code (IaC)

- [healthcoach-platform-iac](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/healthcoach-platform-iac): Terraform configuration for the service's AWS infrastructure.

